# Upload ONLY what the site and its API need. Everything else in this folder
# — team notes (*.md), backups, the legacy Next.js app, local tooling — must
# never be uploaded: the CLI deploy ships the whole working directory,
# tracked or not, and anything uploaded may become publicly reachable.
# Whitelist approach, so a new stray file can't leak by default.
/*
!/craftware-design-v2.html
!/admin.html
!/assets
!/api
!/lib
!/scripts
!/content
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/vercel.json
